{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7900","id":5217280674,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNvliog","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7900","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7900.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7900.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7900","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7900/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7900/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7900/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/statuses/175cf52afbebe1838e1b97362d1f64091a23406e","number":7900,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs(id): decide chat anchor data model","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nAdds the #5870 decision record for the chat anchor data model: typed conversation links, revision-bound part selectors, and anchor survival under edit/delete.\n\n- **Link record and types.** `ConversationLink` is a projection, not a duplicated mutable record. `about`, `anchored-to-part`, and `derived-from` edges fold from #5872's append-only `chat.anchor.v1` events; `resolved-into` folds from #5874's `chat.resolution.v1` edit results. `talk-for` stays #5872's separate canonical binding (`TalkPageBinding`), never a fifth ordinary relation.\n- **Part-anchor representation.** `PartAnchor { origin_revision_id, selector, resolver_fingerprint? }` with text-range, block, and typed-region selectors, plus the version-1 URL-fragment-safe textual grammar (`id://<object-id>#pa1~…`) that #5873's terminal record made conditional on this one.\n- **Survival under edit/delete.** Original revision and selector are immutable. States: `current`, `relocated` (exact unique fingerprint match, warned), `drifted` (approximate/ambiguous, confirmation required), `disputed` (concurrent mutation heads), `unresolved` (insufficient evidence), `orphaned` (part proven removed), `tombstoned` (object deleted), `unbound` (explicit unbind). The conversation and its history survive every state.\n- **Identity contract.** An anchor follows edits only where the object type exposes a stable logical ID, immutable revisions, and a deterministic mapping; revision-only object IDs (e.g. the #2259 document model) leave part anchors pinned.\n- **Privacy.** #5682's non-disclosure rule is applied to link metadata, fingerprints, candidate counts, reverse indexes, search, and the terminal tombstone marker: no content or existence leak to non-readers.\n- **Scope discipline.** No `chat.message.v1` change, no protocol-version bump (unknown-kind tolerance per #5872 invariant 7), no talk-page/terminal/thread-resolution policy re-decided.\n\nAlso indexes the record in `doc/README.md` and `planning/architecture/README.md`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- Prose-only change (change class 0 per `.github/ci-policy.md`); no code tests apply.\n- Checked against the settled sibling records: #5872 (decision comment), #5873 (PR #7614 frame), #5874 (`doc/2026-11-08_decision_id5874_thread_resolution.md`), and parent #5682.\n\nCloses #5870\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added a design record describing how conversations can link to objects and specific parts of their content, including how those links respond to edits, removals, and unresolved changes.\n  * Added the record to the documentation and architecture indexes.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T01:30:02Z","updated_at":"2026-11-10T22:24:12Z","closed_at":"2026-11-10T22:22:33Z","merged_at":"2026-11-10T22:22:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"309d22460f39bf46d082db226cce50dc9c642148","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[{"id":7767549,"node_id":"T_kwDOAZNvF84AdoX9","url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549","members_url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549/members{/member}","name":"codeowners","description":"Team Discussions: developing-today/code","permission":"pull","privacy":"closed","notification_setting":"notifications_enabled","html_url":"https://github.com/orgs/developing-today/teams/codeowners","repositories_url":"https://api.github.com/organizations/26439447/team/7767549/repos","slug":"codeowners","type":"organization","organization_id":26439447,"parent":null}],"head":{"label":"developing-today:queue/12943-5870-chat-anchor","ref":"queue/12943-5870-chat-anchor","repo":{"id":627308783,"node_id":"R_kgDOJWP47w","name":"code","full_name":"developing-today/code","owner":{"login":"developing-today","id":26439447,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdG